+
+April linked [iOS Payment Element address collection](https://docs.stripe.com/payments/mobile/save-during-payment.md?platform=ios&mobile-ui=payment-element#collect-payment-details), [iOS saved payment methods](https://docs.stripe.com/payments/mobile/accept-payment.md?platform=ios&type=payment#enable-saved-cards), and [the standalone setup guide](https://docs.stripe.com/payments/mobile/set-up-future-payments.md). The April demo was an [App Store download](https://apps.apple.com/us/app/stripe-payments-showcase/id6450683352). November provides an [iOS App Clip](https://apps.apple.com/demo/id6450683352?app-clip-bundle-id=com.stripe.PaymentSheetDemo.Clip). The guide links and local or CDN images are dated presentation and navigation.
 
